  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-33-50"><seg source="#source-33-50">お月さまを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-50-70"><seg source="#source-50-70">みいあげた。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-70-99"><seg source="#source-70-99">マストにのぼつた</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-99-122"><seg source="#source-99-122">ふなのりが。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-122-170"><seg source="#source-122-170">何だか青いと、さういつた。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-170-187"><seg source="#source-170-187">お月さまを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-187-207"><seg source="#source-187-207">みいあげた。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-207-233"><seg source="#source-207-233">わたしが窓から</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-233-253"><seg source="#source-233-253">一人きり。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-253-295"><seg source="#source-253-295">母さん静かね、さういつた。</seg></p>
    </body>
